OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of woman who died after
OL,4,A'misread' smear test join calls for
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe family of a 24-year-old woman who
OL,8,Fdied after her smear test was said to
OL,9,Fhave been misread has supported calls
OL,10,Ffor a public inquiry into Northern
OL,11,FIreland's cervical screening service.
OL,13,FLouise Corbett Gibbons, from near
OL,14,FKatesbridge in County Down, died from
OL,15,Fcervical cancer in 2008.
OL,17,FHer death is not linked to the cervical
OL,18,Fscreening scandal involving the
OL,19,FSouthern Health Trust but her widower
OL,20,FNeville Gibbons and aunt Joy Fairley
OL,21,Fjoined campaigners to mark three years
OL,22,Fsince those issues came to light.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
