OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of woman who died after
OL,4,A'misread' smear test join calls for
OL,5,Ainquiry
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Southern Trust scandal led to
OL,8,F17,500 women being approached to have
OL,9,Ftheir smear tests rechecked as part of
OL,10,Fa major review of screening dating back
OL,11,Fto 2008.
